      "message": "I think we need to force a timer interrupt in the \u0027else\u0027 case. If our delay should have caused ITIM32 to overflow, and we make no adjustment, we may after a short while go into deep sleep again, delay for a duration which should cause ITIM32 to overflow, repeat... so we can end up with ITIM32 ticking very \u0027slow\u0027 as we approach overflow point.",
